              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sheila"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Well, the syrup is pretty good and the cooking time was right on the mark..it thickened nicely after just a few mins..but it would be better with about 1/4 tsp cinnamon and maybe 1/4 tsp salt. The topping just doesn't work - no flavor whatsoever. We peeled the bread topping off and just ate the apples and syrup mixture with a little vanilla ice cream. This dessert is bland, sorry.",
